\item{estimatedMarginalMeansEffectSizeSdFactorCovariates, }{Standard deviation factor for covariates when computing estimated marginal means; applies to scale variables.}

\item{estimatedMarginalMeansEffectSizeSelectedVariables, }{Variables selected for computing estimated marginal means in the effect size model.}

\item{estimatedMarginalMeansEffectSizeTestAgainst, }{Option to test the estimated marginal means against a specific value.
