\item{estimatedMarginalMeansHeterogeneityAddAdjustedEstimate, }{Include the adjusted heterogeneity estimate, which accounts for the moderators in the heterogeneity meta-regression model. This provides the heterogeneity estimate adjusted for the influence of moderators, as opposed to the pooled heterogeneity estimate which combines the heterogeneity estimates across all studies.
